ckquote><span></span><p><strong><span>本期嘉宾</span></strong><span>：</span></p><span></span><p><span>职业占星师、塔罗师 </span><strong><span>Hadar</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span>个人公众号：</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/_vbIubXShkie5cXrQSO65w" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/_vbIubXShkie5cXrQSO65w"><strong><span>人间拾乐园</span></strong></a></blockquote><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家关注</span><strong><span>@闲话占星</span></strong><span>，这是一档轻松聊占星的播客节目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果播客没听够，想了解更多，也欢迎关注我们的公众号和微信，爱你❤️。</span></p>]]></description>
